[ti:Lyric HUD Demo]
[ar:Lyric HUD]
[00:01.00]Welcome to Lyric HUD
[00:04.50]Your lyrics stay pinned in the corner
[00:09.00]Every word lights up while it is sung
[00:13.50]Play a song on Spotify or YouTube
[00:18.00]and the words will follow along
[00:22.50]Press K to hide or show the lyrics
[00:27.00]Use /lyrichud offset to fix the timing
[00:31.50]That is all, now enjoy the music
[00:36.00]
